{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And a bribe.</b> He mentioned all this as well, because the rich man gives a bribe to the judge to pervert the judgment of the poor." "<b>And it subverts the words of the righteous.</b> The Gaon [Saadia] said that צדיקים is an adjective for דברי, but this is impossible, for דברי is in construct state." "And the meaning of צדיקים is righteous in judgment, not righteous in commandments."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:34.660627935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}